 Project Proposal
- Product: A club recruitment poster for the campus handicraft club
- Platform: Canva
- Reader: University students who love handcrafts and want to join the club
 Tasks:
  1. Design the main recruitment poster with club intro, activity preview and sign-up information.
  2. Adjust layout, colour palette and text content to fit social media and campus poster display.
 Document Plan
  1. Final poster design file and preview image
  2. Design notes: layout logic, colour selection and copywriting explanation
  3. Revision record of draft versions
 Tool choice explanation
I pick Canva for this poster design task, as it provides plenty of ready-made templates, fonts and graphic elements for quick visual creation.
Its intuitive drag-and-drop interface lets me easily adjust details and export files for both print and online sharing.
